'''Loth-bat gliders''' were aerial [[Glider (vehicle)|gliders]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|loth-bat-glider|Loth-bat glider}}</ref> utilized by the rebel group known as the [[Spectres]] during their [[Rescue of Hera Syndulla (Lothal)|rescue]] of their [[pilot]], [[Hera Syndulla]]. They were designed to emulate the appearance of [[Loth-bat]]s native to the [[planet]] [[Lothal]].<ref name="JN">{{Rebels|Jedi Night}}</ref>

